    <Sign Type="Sign" X="0" Y="9">
      <Message>Enchanted Garden - Here dance the Fae. When you sniff the flowers, beware, for there are green mantises that will catch a whiff of you, and more, if you are not cautious or fleet!</Message>
    </Sign>
    <Sign Type="Sign" X="1" Y="0">
      <Message>Woodland Trail - Wolf walk the trail in hunt of fair Aislings. Adventure in a group, or better: Keep your distance from this place!</Message>
    </Sign>
    <Sign Type="Sign" X="6" Y="0">
      <Message>Woodland Trail - Sinister and elemental wolves lurk the path. Beware and do not travel further!</Message>
    </Sign>
    <Sign Type="Sign" X="11" Y="0">
      <Message>Kobold's Vale - Journey not, lest you should perish under their jackaline grin!</Message>
    </Sign>
    <Sign Type="Sign" X="15" Y="0">
      <Message>Kobold's Vale - The other vale pales to the dangers herein. Heed warnings well. Hereforth await kobolds with teeth barred for your death!</Message>
    </Sign>
    <Sign Type="Sign" X="19" Y="0">
      <Message>Goblin's Way - Turn back. Turn back! Goblins hunt within these woods. Don't fall prey to their blow or elemental summons! Turn back, I pray!</Message>
    </Sign>
    <Sign Type="Sign" X="23" Y="14">
      <Message>Wasteland - All the green has been eaten away by the hungry things. Young Aisling, adventure cautiously within.</Message>
    </Sign>
